<section id="about" class="sec" style="max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:128px 24px 0">
	<div class="reveal" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-bottom:44px">
		<span class="mono" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--atext);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase" data-i18n="about.label">01 — About</span>
		<h2 class="display" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.8vw,58px);line-height:1.04;font-weight:700;max-width:760px" data-i18n="about.headline">Solving problems, learning fast, owning delivery.</h2>
	</div>
	<div class="reveal" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:stretch;gap:20px">
		<div class="glass calm" style="flex:2 1 460px;border-radius:28px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;min-width:0">
			<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink2)" data-i18n="about.p1">
				I'm a software engineer with a background mainly in retail logistics software. I work in
				international teams alongside engineers and specialists from different countries. I have a
				reliable and flexible personality, equally comfortable collaborating in a team and driving
				things independently, with a continuous focus on problem-solving and learning new
				technologies.
			</p>
			<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink2)" data-i18n="about.p2">
				My role has been evolving beyond hands-on engineering toward owning how a project gets
				delivered day to day — coordinating across engineering teams, presenting technical
				decisions to business stakeholders, and using AI tooling to take on more scope and move
				faster. I'm working toward growing this into a full management role, applying that same
				AI-accelerated approach at a larger scale.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div style="flex:1 1 300px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;min-width:0">
			<div class="glass calm" style="border-radius:28px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;min-width:0">
				<span class="mono" style="font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--atext);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase" data-i18n="about.languages">Languages</span>
				<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
					<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)">
						<span style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px" data-i18n="about.languageNames.0">Hungarian</span>
						<span style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)" data-i18n="about.languageLevels.0">Native</span>
					</div>
					<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)">
						<span style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px" data-i18n="about.languageNames.1">English</span>
						<span style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)" data-i18n="about.languageLevels.1">Professional</span>
					</div>
					<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)">
						<span style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px" data-i18n="about.languageNames.2">German</span>
						<span style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)" data-i18n="about.languageLevels.2">Professional</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="glass calm" style="flex:1 1 auto;border-radius:28px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;min-width:0">
				<span class="mono" style="font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--atext);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase" data-i18n="about.outsideWork">Outside of work</span>
				<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px">
					<span class="chip" data-i18n="about.interests.0">Gym</span>
					<span class="chip" data-i18n="about.interests.1">Tennis</span>
					<span class="chip" data-i18n="about.interests.2">Gastronomy</span>
					<span class="chip" data-i18n="about.interests.3">Finance &amp; Investing</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
